{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111130","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111130","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1311113001:1":{"text":"奇怪……明明满满每一剑都砍到那棵树了，可是根本砍不断它！","source_cn":"奇怪……明明满满每一剑都砍到那棵树了，可是根本砍不断它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D0ADA4BD07131D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311113002:1":{"text":"我的魔法也烧不掉……","source_cn":"我的魔法也烧不掉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x537F21AF0630A7D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311113003:1":{"text":"我们绕路过去吧，我记得这附近还有一条路……那条路通往……","source_cn":"我们绕路过去吧，我记得这附近还有一条路……那条路通往……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B55F11D596725A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311113004:1":{"text":"瓦丽卡？","source_cn":"瓦丽卡？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2998044E2306B666","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311113005:1":{"text":"通往……应该有一条路，但我突然想不起来了……对这片森林的记忆一下子变得很模糊……","source_cn":"通往……应该有一条路，但我突然想不起来了……对这片森林...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0C637CAF82BE417","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"s